  "result": "I made the three fixes in four files. I did not run the test suite, since the task was an edit-only one.\n\n- **Non-subscribers getting digests:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now only matches rows where `digestOnly` is true. Before, any preference row counted.\n- **Oldest-first digest:** `listUnreadSince` in `src/server/repositories/notification-repository.ts` now orders newest first. The cap in `buildDigest` then keeps the most recent entries, and the headline comes from the newest one. I removed the now-unused `asc` import.\n- **Archived workspaces sending digests:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` returns false when `org.archivedAt` is set, so the job skips those orgs entirely.",
